{"2838950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Game of Thrones: War for Westeros", "steam_appid": 2838950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/dc00e7c89e971b9ab59e5c8fc0db3f6d.poster.avif?t=1787820939\" aria-label=\"Game of Thrones: War for Westeros: Classic real-time strategy in the world of Westeros.\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/dc00e7c89e971b9ab59e5c8fc0db3f6d.webm?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/dc00e7c89e971b9ab59e5c8fc0db3f6d.mp4?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/d508e1032bffef12948406e416b162fd.avif?t=1787820939\" alt=\"&quot;When you play the Game of Thrones, you win or you die.&quot; - Cersei Lannister\" width=1205 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In War for Westeros, chaos reigns in ruthless battles across the Seven Kingdoms. Command the Great Houses in epic real-time strategy battles, and stake your claim to the Iron Throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/20a4cfe437ff47fc19d1a5a212e3c207.poster.avif?t=1787820939\" aria-label=\"Call Your Banners: Lead the armies of House Stark, House Lannister, House Targaryen, or raise an army of the dead as the Night King himself. Each faction offers deeply asymmetric strategies, with signature heroes, armies, and mechanics forged from the brutal legacy of Westeros. Choose your banner and rewrite the fate of the realm.\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/20a4cfe437ff47fc19d1a5a212e3c207.webm?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/20a4cfe437ff47fc19d1a5a212e3c207.mp4?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/f50ba8cc8e62375fb6809ea88618c5d1.poster.avif?t=1787820939\" aria-label=\"Wage War Across Westeros: Take command in brutal real-time battles across the fields of Westeros. Deploy infantry, cavalry, siege engines, giants, and dragons to break enemy lines and hold your own. Outplay your rivals with smart maneuvering, inspiring hero abilities, and the ruthless instincts of a true war commander.\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/f50ba8cc8e62375fb6809ea88618c5d1.webm?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/f50ba8cc8e62375fb6809ea88618c5d1.mp4?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/500354ca567690e8b845c95bb3b32b13.poster.avif?t=1787820939\" aria-label=\"From the Wall to King’s Landing, banners will rise. Lead your House to claim the Iron Throne in a solo campaign across Westeros or in bloody multiplayer skirmishes. Rally powerful bannermen, sway loyalties, and outmaneuver your enemies in an ever shifting struggle for power. Re-envision the most iconic battles and turning points from the Game of Thrones series. You decide who wins, and who dies.\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/500354ca567690e8b845c95bb3b32b13.webm?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/500354ca567690e8b845c95bb3b32b13.mp4?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/b3716a569958bb36edcd9636be91114b.poster.avif?t=1787820939\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/b3716a569958bb36edcd9636be91114b.webm?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/b3716a569958bb36edcd9636be91114b.mp4?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/dc00e7c89e971b9ab59e5c8fc0db3f6d.poster.avif?t=1787820939\" aria-label=\"Game of Thrones: War for Westeros: Classic real-time strategy in the world of Westeros.\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/dc00e7c89e971b9ab59e5c8fc0db3f6d.webm?t=1787820939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838950/extras/dc00e7c89e971b9ab59e5c8fc0db3f6d.mp4?t=1787820939\"